<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-C.BANK REGISTERS NEW HERMIS SHARE CAPITAL.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-C.BANK REGISTERS NEW HERMIS SHARE CAPITAL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Friday that it registered the 23 million litas share capital of Hermis Bank .</p>
<p>Hermis has boosted its share capital by 23 million litas to 90 million litas.</p>
<p>Hermis' shareholders bought 65 percent of the new shares and the rest, over eight million litas, will be issued via global depository receipts (GDRs).</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
